      "translation_text_hash": "73520abeab8c9236060f480d64b48eea1e4a12b99c426778ab09d370b2068f2f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 날마다 주를 송축하며 영영히 주의 이름을 송축하리이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "73520abeab8c9236060f480d64b48eea1e4a12b99c426778ab09d370b2068f2f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:145:3",
