        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 145,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "Great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised! His greatness is unsearchable.",
      "ko": "여호와는 광대하시니 크게 찬양할 것이라 그의 광대하심을 측량치 못하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "52efcaef662ef5353a15f4df025c0125df09ea5a501b9d8f63c6cb1e7727bb42",
      "translation_text_hash": "74b2fadc96ebb2352a8409c1bc64ad03e1cd8007950e62cb0d0d89e6148c1d71",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와는 광대하시니 크게 찬양할 것이라 그의 광대하심을 측량치 못하리로다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "74b2fadc96ebb2352a8409c1bc64ad03e1cd8007950e62cb0d0d89e6148c1d71"
      ]
    },
    {
